PLACEHOLDER — choose a license before this repository is made public.

For research code accompanying a paper the usual choices are MIT (permissive,
simplest) or Apache-2.0 (permissive + explicit patent grant). Some venues or
institutions require a specific one; check before deciding.

Note that a license covers the CODE only. It does not grant any rights over
ISIC 2019 or PAD-UFES-20, which carry their own terms, nor over any pretrained
checkpoint in assets/checkpoints/ — each of those has its own license and some
are non-commercial. Record them in assets/README.md.

Replace this file, and log the choice as a decision.
